From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:27:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(metainfo): declare GPL-3.0-only and describe
 synchronization

Motivation: the AppStream files still carried the placeholder licence
LicenseRef-proprietary and the sentence "It does not synchronize, transfer
or delete files", from before synchronization existed. Software centres
built from distribution metadata (Discover, GNOME Software) show both.

Changes: project_license GPL-3.0-only, as README.md, LICENSE and Cargo.toml
state; the old sentence replaced by "It synchronizes the folders you choose
with Google Drive. It never deletes files permanently.", in English and nine
translations, for the normal and development profiles.

Validation: appstreamcli validate --no-net on both files.

Limitations: none known.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5)
Origin: vendor, Sparky Stereo OS (branch order299 of the edition's DriveSync fork)
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
---
 data/com.rtosta.DriveSync.Devel.metainfo.xml | 14 +++++++++++---
 data/com.rtosta.DriveSync.metainfo.xml       | 14 +++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/data/com.rtosta.DriveSync.Devel.metainfo.xml b/data/com.rtosta.DriveSync.Devel.metainfo.xml
index 6c5cc97..d26a273 100644
--- a/data/com.rtosta.DriveSync.Devel.metainfo.xml
+++ b/data/com.rtosta.DriveSync.Devel.metainfo.xml
@@ -5,12 +5,20 @@
   <summary>Google account management for Linux</summary>
   <summary xml:lang="pt_BR">Gerenciamento de contas do Google para Linux</summary>
   <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
-  <project_license>LicenseRef-proprietary</project_license>
+  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
   <description>
     <p>DriveSync is an experimental desktop application for connecting Google accounts and editing their local names.</p>
     <p xml:lang="pt_BR">O DriveSync é um aplicativo experimental para conectar contas do Google e editar seus nomes locais.</p>
-    <p>It does not synchronize, transfer or delete files.</p>
-    <p xml:lang="pt_BR">Ele não sincroniza, transfere ou exclui arquivos.</p>
+    <p>It synchronizes the folders you choose with Google Drive. It never deletes files permanently.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="pt_BR">Ele sincroniza com o Google Drive as pastas que você escolher. Ele nunca exclui arquivos permanentemente.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="pl">Synchronizuje wybrane foldery z Dyskiem Google. Nigdy nie usuwa plików trwale.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="fr">Il synchronise avec Google Drive les dossiers que vous choisissez. Il ne supprime jamais de fichiers définitivement.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="de">Es synchronisiert die von Ihnen gewählten Ordner mit Google Drive. Es löscht niemals Dateien endgültig.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="es">Sincroniza con Google Drive las carpetas que elijas. Nunca elimina archivos de forma permanente.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="ja">選んだフォルダーを Google ドライブと同期します。ファイルを完全に削除することはありません。</p>
+    <p xml:lang="ko">선택한 폴더를 Google 드라이브와 동기화합니다. 파일을 영구적으로 삭제하지 않습니다.</p>
+    <p xml:lang="zh_CN">它会将你选择的文件夹与 Google 云端硬盘同步。它从不永久删除文件。</p>
+    <p xml:lang="zh_TW">它會將您選擇的資料夾與 Google 雲端硬碟同步。它從不永久刪除檔案。</p>
   </description>
   <launchable type="desktop-id">com.rtosta.DriveSync.Devel.desktop</launchable>
   <url type="homepage">https://github.com/rafatosta/drivesync</url>
